  m_Name: WhatBreathesUnderTheRoots
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: SafeHaven::QuestDefinition
  id: whatbreathesundertheroots
  displayName: What Breathes Under the Roots
  description: 'The roots that closed the road, the roots that choked the portal''s stones, the roots in the breach''s dead: one thing is pushing them. Something old breathes under them in a hollow deep in the Misty Woods. It will not wake for steel. Carry an ember from your own hearth to it, wake it, and bring it down.'
  chain: The Hearth and the Door
  journalNotes: 'Make the ember at any campfire, from three sticks. The portal''s briefing tells you when the hollow can be found: it marks the place for the whole raid. The Heartroot fights in three stages, and it can be fought again on a later raid if it beats you; what you learned of it stays learned.


    It is the forest''s guardian, or it was. Nobody at home is sure which.'
